<voice name='ウォルフ' class='ウォルフ' src='voice/mc02/0130140a13'>
//「何故、人はパンツを穿く？」
"Why do human beings wear underpants?"

pt:
//【ウォルフ】
<voice name='ウォルフ' class='ウォルフ' src='voice/mc02/0130140a13'>
